    "1663667029efc274af": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "1663667029f86d6497-0": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What payment methods can I use?",
            "open": false,
            "content": "<p>We offer 35 different payment methods including major providers like Mastercard, Visa, PayPal, American Express and Diners as well as many different local payment methods including Klarna, iDEAL, AliPay, Sofort, giropay, and many more.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "1663667029f86d6497-1": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I purchase items with another currency?",
            "open": false,
            "content": "<p>Yes, you may select a currency based on your personal preference. When you select the currency on the upper right of the website,all prices on the online store and checkout are automatically converted to that currency.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "1663667029f86d6497-2": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I make changes to my order after it’s been placed?",
            "open": false,
            "content": "<p>We do everything we can to fulfill orders quickly and unfortunately cannot make updates after an order has been placed. These changes include removing or adding products and/or changing the delivery address. If a mistake has been made with your order information, it’s quickest to create a new order with the correct information and then let our Customer Service know at <a href=\"mailto:order@moodytiger.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"mailto:order@moodytiger.com\">order@moodytiger.com</a> .</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "1663667029f86d6497-3": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do you offer e-gift cards for international customers?",
            "open": false,
            "content": "<p>E-gift cards are only available to customers shipping within the U.S.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "68288bd2-3db2-455d-a841-5aa19d752abb": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How Do I Set Up A Subscription Order?",
            "open": false,
            "content": "<p>We will deliver products to you as soon as reasonably possible. Orders are usually dispatched between 1-3 days from the date of the order being placed. Please contact us our customer service team at <a href=\"mailto:order@moodytiger.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"mailto:order@moodytiger.com\">order@moodytiger.com</a> if your delivery has not been received within the dates described.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "de9966d6-0cd0-4b0f-9810-aa062aff88ce": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How To Return My Items?",
            "open": false,
            "content": "<p>At moodytiger, if you're not happy with your purchase for any reason, please <a href=\"https://360.postco.co/moodytiger_return\" title=\"moodytiger return portal\"><strong>Click this link</strong></a> to request submit the return request, and we will offer you solutions according to your case.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
